abstract: >-
  Machine-checked Agda formalization of Dana Scott's PROGIC 2013 extended
  abstract Stochastic λ-calculi (Journal of Applied Logic 12 (2014), 369–376),
  covering the graph model of untyped λ-calculus via enumeration operators
  and its expansion by random combinators.
keywords:
  - Agda
  - lambda calculus
  - graph model
  - enumeration operators
  - stochastic lambda calculus
  - random combinators
  - formal verification
